{"id":113,"name":"الفلق","transliteration":"Al-Falaq","translation_fr":"L'aube naissante","translation_en":"The Daybreak","type":"meccan","total_verses":5,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلۡفَلَقِ","translation_fr":"Dis: «Je cherche protection auprès du Seigneur de l'aube naissante","translation_en":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak","transliteration":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alfalaqi"},{"id":2,"text":"مِن شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ","translation_fr":"contre le mal des êtres qu'Il a créés","translation_en":"From the evil of that which He created","transliteration":"Min sharri ma khalaqa"},{"id":3,"text":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","translation_fr":"contre le mal de l'obscurité quand elle s'approfondit","translation_en":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles","transliteration":"Wamin sharri ghasiqin itha waqaba"},{"id":4,"text":"وَمِن شَرِّ ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ فِي ٱلۡعُقَدِ","translation_fr":"contre le mal de celles qui soufflent [les sorcières] sur les nœuds","translation_en":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots","transliteration":"Wamin sharri alnnaffathati fee alAAuqadi"},{"id":5,"text":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","translation_fr":"et contre le mal de l'envieux quand il envie»","translation_en":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies","transliteration":"Wamin sharri hasidin itha hasada"}]}